gZp(){return"# Title / Author\n\n## A line worth keeping\n> Copy a passage out here, and reading it back brings the whole feeling of the book with it.\n\n## Thoughts\n- What stayed with me\n- What I'd tell someone about it\n\nAdd a page each time you finish a book, and the whole shelf ends up in this one note."},
